      "x": 3470,
      "y": 345,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "Cyclones/index.html (Hub)\nTopics: Cyclone science, meteorological\nhistory, 6 archived events\n\nCyclone_Tracy/index.html\n  Darwin 1974, Cat 4, 217 km/h\n\nCyclone_Larry/index.html\n  Innisfail 2006, Cat 5, 240 km/h\n\nCyclone_Althea/index.html\n  Townsville 1971, Cat 4, building codes\n\nCyclone_George/index.html\n  Port Hedland 2007, Cat 5, iron ore\n\nCyclone_Mahina/index.html\n  Bathurst Bay 1899, 13m storm surge\n\nCyclone_Yasi/index.html\n  Mission Beach 2011, Cat 5, 285 km/h",
