      "y": 1675,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 380,
      "text": "Bushfires/index.html (Hub)\nTopics: Fire ecology, national identity,\nvolunteer spirit, fire continent\n\nBlack_Saturday/index.html\n  2009, fire ratings reform\nAsh_Wednesday/index.html\n  1983, wind-change fatalities\nBlack_Summer/index.html\n  2019-20, 20m+ hectares, mega-fires\n\nFire_Science/index.html\n  FFDI, fire behaviour physics\nPrevention_Prep/index.html\n  Hazard reduction, fuel loads, ratings\nThe_Frontline/index.html\n  Emergency services, containment\nArsonist_Birds/index.html\n  Firehawk raptors, Indigenous knowledge\nElemental_Magic/index.html\n  Wildlife adaptation & fire survival",
